==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*3 [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*4 [[Star Peng]]s spawn, delay 30~40 seconds<sup>900f~1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 26.67~43.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,300f</sup>.
*2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 40~66.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Lowkey]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Barring the Trolly Bloggers, all of the enemies in this stage spawn in limited amounts, meaning once you've killed the last few peons, Lowkey is easy to clean up. Due to Lowkey's curse, it is better to bring generalist, damage-oriented units over specialized ones. Some recommended units to bring are [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cats]] or [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] for general area damage, high damage units such as [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], and any units that can outrange Lowkey, like [[Li'l Nyandam (Special Cat)|Schoolbus Nyandam]] or [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]].

Make sure to bring at least 2 to 3 meatshields, as the peons can push into your stack a bit.

==Trivia==
*Cricket Ideology uses the same [[Backgrounds|background]] as [[wikipedia:Iriomote Island|Iriomote Island]], the [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|48th stage]] of [[Empire of Cats]] in the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]] and [[Battle Cats (Removed Game)|original English version]].
*Cricket Ideology is the only [[Uncanny Legends]] stage to be a remake of a stage from a [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapter]].

